{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hero System</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232480/extras/47232977c38d1f367fec947f09e46971.poster.avif?t=1773184985\" width=960 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232480/extras/47232977c38d1f367fec947f09e46971.webm?t=1773184985\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232480/extras/47232977c38d1f367fec947f09e46971.mp4?t=1773184985\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assign <strong>Heroes</strong> to your turrets to completely overhaul their performance. This adds a critical layer of tactical depth. Each hero features unique specializations: from buffing adjacent towers and boosting resource extraction to wielding devastating fire elements. Your choice of hero dictates your entire strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Modules</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232480/extras/7b51b12394884b9f9510a68a013f417d.poster.avif?t=1773184985\" width=960 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232480/extras/7b51b12394884b9f9510a68a013f417d.webm?t=1773184985\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232480/extras/7b51b12394884b9f9510a68a013f417d.mp4?t=1773184985\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s not just about building and upgrading turrets. Combine them with <strong>Modules</strong> \u2014 a deep upgrade system that fundamentally alters turret functionality, offering infinite build variety and massive replayability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Abilities</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232480/extras/15919f8e312cccc44f5c028440e9592c.poster.avif?t=1773184985\" width=960 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232480/extras/15919f8e312cccc44f5c028440e9592c.webm?t=1773184985\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232480/extras/15919f8e312cccc44f5c028440e9592c.mp4?t=1773184985\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash powerful <strong>Ability Cards</strong> to turn the tide of battle. Incinerate waves with a wall of fire, weaken enemies for the upcoming round, or supercharge a turret at the cost of sacrificing its neighbors. Experiment with synergies to find the ultimate winning combo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3232480?t=1773184985","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232480/5e5f498dc1789cedb95ad64d0e0200e10ed0c804/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773184985","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232480/1675a33c8889bee522ca55f94ee5ffaeef0acda2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773184985","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232480/1675a33c8889bee522ca55f94ee5ffaeef0acda2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773184985","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4480420,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hero System</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232480/extras/47232977c38d1f367fec947f09e46971.poster.avif?t=1773184985\" width=960 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232480/extras/47232977c38d1f367fec947f09e46971.webm?t=1773184985\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232480/extras/47232977c38d1f367fec947f09e46971.mp4?t=1773184985\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assign <strong>Heroes</strong> to your turrets to completely overhaul their performance. This adds a critical layer of tactical depth. Each hero features unique specializations: from buffing adjacent towers and boosting resource extraction to wielding devastating fire elements. Your choice of hero dictates your entire strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Modules</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232480/extras/7b51b12394884b9f9510a68a013f417d.poster.avif?t=1773184985\" width=960 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232480/extras/7b51b12394884b9f9510a68a013f417d.webm?t=1773184985\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232480/extras/7b51b12394884b9f9510a68a013f417d.mp4?t=1773184985\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s not just about building and upgrading turrets. Combine them with <strong>Modules</strong> \u2014 a deep upgrade system that fundamentally alters turret functionality, offering infinite build variety and massive replayability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Abilities</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232480/extras/15919f8e312cccc44f5c028440e9592c.poster.avif?t=1773184985\" width=960 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232480/extras/15919f8e312cccc44f5c028440e9592c.webm?t=1773184985\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232480/extras/15919f8e312cccc44f5c028440e9592c.mp4?t=1773184985\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash powerful <strong>Ability Cards</strong> to turn the tide of battle. Incinerate waves with a wall of fire, weaken enemies for the upcoming round, or supercharge a turret at the cost of sacrificing its neighbors. Experiment with synergies to find the ultimate winning combo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Proud Turkeys"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232480/header.jpg?t=1773184985","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple Silicone<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple Silicone<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3232480/1532147690/6e8c1c7ec4a2f591da97407bc0d54e98873593a0/1750883171/dash_av1.mpd?t=1747488387","dash_h